      "text": "I can't quote a dock for this setup. None of the docks in your budget is confirmed to run two displays at 4K 60 Hz from a USB-C (DisplayPort Alt Mode) port.\n\n- **Demo Dock Duo (OAW-DOCK-04), $129.00:** I can't confirm it fits. The USB-C port check passes. The store hasn't filled in how many 4K 60 Hz displays it supports (`max_displays_4k60`), so the two-display check came back \"unknown\". It has 2 video outputs and 90 W power delivery, but that doesn't tell me it can run both at 4K 60 Hz.\n- **Demo Dock Duo Lite (OAW-DOCK-03), $89.00:** It's incompatible. The USB-C port check passes, but the dock supports only 1 display at 4K 60 Hz and you need 2.\n- **Demo Dock Travel (OAW-DOCK-01), $39.00, and Demo Dock Solo (OAW-DOCK-02), $59.00:** Both list 1 output and 1 display at 4K 60 Hz. I didn't run the compatibility check on them, so these two are based on their listed specs only. They can't drive two displays.\n\nBecause no dock passed both checks, I haven't created a quote or quote_id.\n\nThe Demo Dock Duo is the only possible fit, and it depends on the store filling in its 4K 60 Hz display spec. If you'd like, I can look again later. I can also check the docks against a different setup, for example one 4K 60 Hz display.",
